  "learningJourneyFiqhBasicsOutcome2": "Gain confidence in cleanliness, prayer, fasting, and zakat basics.",
  "learningJourneyFiqhBasicsOutcome3": "Handle simple everyday questions with more calm and clarity.",
  "learningJourneyFiqhBasicsWhyThisMatters": "Practical knowledge helps worship stay steady and keeps daily life grounded in what Allah loves.",
