  "profileWhatsNewDateMarch2026": "March 2026",
  "profileWhatsNewDateFebruary2026": "February 2026",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Title": "Refined onboarding, motion, and prayer widgets",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Summary": "This update tightened early app setup, smoothed page transitions, and made prayer widgets calmer and more controlled.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Item1": "Merged name and Brother/Sister selection into one onboarding step and left the name blank by default.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Item2": "Made habit tracking optional at the start so users can opt in later at their own pace.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Item3": "Applied subtle page entrance animation across shared pages and onboarding, with full respect for Reduce Motion.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Item4": "Removed second-by-second prayer Live Activity countdowns and added separate stable controls for Dynamic Island and lock screen widgets.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Item5": "Simplified theme mode so the calm Path of Nūr look is the default theme.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry112Title": "Trusted-source Qur''anic Arabic improvements",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry112Summary": "The Learn Qur''anic Arabic content now uses stricter source handling so visible Qur''anic examples are more traceable and consistent.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry112Item1": "Audited letters, word examples, phrase lessons, and rule examples to use trusted Qur''anic references where appropriate.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry112Item2": "Added source references directly into the lesson flow so examples can be traced back clearly.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry112Item3": "Source-locked the seeded 100-word Qur''anic Arabic dataset so future additions require source metadata.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry111Title": "Islamic Trivia and Knowledge Paths",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry111Summary": "Trivia expanded into a fuller learning feature with structured question packs and guided topic journeys.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry111Item1": "Added Islamic Trivia with category-based questions, review flow, daily quiz behavior, stats, and rewards integration.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry111Item2": "Introduced Knowledge Paths for guided learning journeys with short learning cards and staged quizzes.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry111Item3": "Expanded curated trivia packs for Prophets, Qur''an Basics, Salah, Ramadan, Du''a, Seerah, and Islamic History.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry110Title": "Smarter Qur''anic Arabic practice",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry110Summary": "Qur''anic Arabic learning became more adaptive, with more meaningful review and guidance across the teaching flow.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry110Item1": "Added a Smart Daily Review system with spaced review and adaptive weak-area targeting.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry110Item2": "Introduced memory-strength tracking, review history, and calmer progress visibility on the teaching dashboard.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry110Item3": "Moved Learn Qur''anic Arabic into its own dedicated Learn destination for easier discovery.",
  "profileComingSoonRoadmapTitle": "On the roadmap",
